OL,3,AUK sanctions firms over Israeli West
OL,4,ABank settlements
OL,5,
OL,6,FSettlements are illegal under
OL,7,Finternational law, and there has been a
OL,8,Frise in violence towards Palestinians
OL,9,Fin the West Bank by settlers in recent
OL,10,Fmonths.
OL,12,FIt comes two days before the deadline
OL,13,Ffor bids for construction tenders in
OL,14,Fthe E1 area east of Jerusalem.
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
